# OWNLOCAL LIVE – Production Implementation Brief

## 1. Goal

Build OWNLOCAL LIVE as a production-ready local marketplace for:

- Customers
- Merchants
- Delivery Partners
- Admin

The product should support local discovery, ordering, delivery assignment, live tracking, payment handling, merchant inventory, rider operations, and admin controls.

Initial launch target: Ilkal.

The product should later scale to additional towns/cities without redesigning the core architecture.

