# 5. Backend Architecture

Use Cloudflare.

Core components:

```text
React Native App
       |
       v
Cloudflare Workers API
       |
       +------ D1
       |
       +------ R2
       |
       +------ Durable Objects
       |
       +------ Queues
```

Use:

- Cloudflare Workers → API/business logic
- Cloudflare D1 → relational database
- Cloudflare R2 → images/documents
- Durable Objects → real-time order/rider state
- WebSockets → live rider tracking
- Cloudflare Queues → notifications/webhooks/background jobs

Never expose D1/R2 directly to the mobile app.

All access must go through Workers.

