# 11. Orders

Recommended order state machine:

```text
CREATED

MERCHANT_CONFIRMATION_PENDING

MERCHANT_CONFIRMED

RIDER_ASSIGNMENT_PENDING

RIDER_ASSIGNED

PAYMENT_PENDING

PAYMENT_CONFIRMED

PREPARING

READY_FOR_PICKUP

PICKED_UP

OUT_FOR_DELIVERY

DELIVERED
```

Exceptional states:

```text
MERCHANT_REJECTED
CUSTOMER_CANCELLED
RIDER_CANCELLED
PAYMENT_FAILED
REFUND_PENDING
REFUNDED
FAILED
```

Do not allow arbitrary status transitions.

Create a backend state machine validating every transition.

