# 15. Rider Location Updates

Do not store every GPS update permanently in D1.

Recommended:

```text
Rider mobile app
      |
      v
Cloudflare Worker
      |
      v
Durable Object
```

Use WebSocket for active delivery.

Example update interval:

```text
5–15 seconds while actively delivering
```

Use slower interval while online but idle.

Persist occasional snapshots if required for:

- disputes
- audit
- delivery analytics

