# 24. Security

Mandatory:

- HTTPS only
- authentication on protected APIs
- server-side authorization
- role-based access control
- request validation
- rate limiting
- secure secret storage
- encrypted external credentials
- audit logging
- document access controls
- payment webhook verification
- OTP rate limiting

Never trust:

```text
role supplied by frontend
price supplied by frontend
merchant ownership supplied by frontend
payment status supplied by frontend
delivery status supplied without authorization
```

All prices and totals must be recalculated server-side.

