# 36. Important Product Rule

Treat this as production software.

Do not implement shortcuts such as:

```text
fake payment success
plain passwords
public KYC documents
client-side authorization
hard-coded API keys
direct database calls from the mobile application
unvalidated status updates
```

The original project explicitly identifies verified merchants/riders, legitimate payment integration, accurate order state, support/refunds and data security as minimum gates before launch.

