# 37. Codex First Task

Start by creating the production repository structure and foundation.

Do not implement the entire system in one giant change.

First:

1. Create React Native Expo TypeScript app.
2. Configure Expo Router.
3. Create shared design system using OWNLOCAL LIVE branding.
4. Create Customer/Merchant/Rider role navigation.
5. Add development seed data.
6. Create Cloudflare Worker project.
7. Configure D1.
8. Create initial migrations.
9. Create typed API client.
10. Add README explaining local setup.
11. Ensure Android can run successfully.
12. Commit the foundation before implementing real features.

Use clean TypeScript, reusable components and production-quality folder organization.

Do not introduce Supabase.

Backend must use Cloudflare Workers + D1 + R2 architecture.
